     "type": "text",
     "html": "<h2><strong>Premium Quality Tesla Vinyl Wraps In Toronto</strong></h2> <p>Looking to wrap your Tesla? you\u2019re on the right page. We have the right equipment, material and care that is required to handle such a premium vehicle. Whether you\u2019re looking for some cool racing stripes or a complete colour change, we will make it happen.</p> <p>Some of the Tesla vehicles that we have wrapped include but are not limited to:</p> <ul> <li>Tesla Model 3</li> <li>Tesla Model X</li> <li>Tesla Model S</li> <li>Tesla Model Y</li> <li>Cybertruck</li> </ul> <p>Our experienced installers treat every vehicle as if it was their own and pay attention to the details that make a premium vehicle \u201cPremium\u201d. Check out our <a href=\"/vinyl-car-wrap-our-portfolio/\">Portfolio</a> for more pictures.</p> <p></p>"
    }
   ]
